;    1: TDecorate(count=202, unk2=5265653, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=, ruby=, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
;    2: TDecorate(count=27, unk2=16757864, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=, ruby=, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
;    3: TDecorate(count=4, unk2=6413008, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=, ruby=, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
;    4: TDecorate(count=1, unk2=4294967295, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=, ruby=じい, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
;    5: TDecorate(count=29, unk2=11271932, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=, ruby=, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
; Display conditions:
;    0: TWdCondition(count=1087, target=)
; Links:
;    0: TWdLink(count=992, event=, unk3=)
;---------------------------------------
; BEGIN DECOMPILED SCRIPT
;---------------------------------------
<SCENARIO VER="105">
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYSND "環境音\春の山.ogg" "SE" "REPEAT" "0" "0"}
{CHGVOL "SE" "1000" "5000" "PASS"}
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\集会場.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
{CREATECG "文字カウント画像" "グラフィック\システム\文字カウント画像.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<TXSPN>"<STYLE ID="1">Kotaro-kun</STYLE>, it pains me to ask <STYLE ID="1">you</STYLE> this, but we can't just leave our doubts as doubts, either. 
{PAUSE ""}
Everyone has gathered here like this. Please, tell us honestly."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"............"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"The other day, <STYLE ID="2">Chigaya-chan</STYLE> missed <STYLE ID="3">Eiichiro-kun's</STYLE> third-year memorial service because she was in the hospital, I hear."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Yes."</STYLE><PG>
"What illness was it, exactly?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"It was just a cold that got worse."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Which hospital?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"............"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Yesterday I asked at several hospitals, but none of them said anything about <STYLE ID="2">Chigaya-chan</STYLE> being admitted."<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"Isn't that to protect patients' privacy...?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Hmm, true enough. 
{PAUSE ""}
But what we're most concerned about is <STYLE ID="2">Chigaya-chan's</STYLE> eye color."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"............"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"For her eye color to change, something serious must have happened. 
{PAUSE ""}
Of course you know the reason, don't you, <STYLE ID="1">Kotaro-kun</STYLE>?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"No, I don't know anything..."</STYLE><PG>
"My great-<STYLE ID="4" RUBY="じい">grandfather</STYLE> used to say this. 
{PAUSE ""}
{STOPSND "SE" "0" "PASS"}
A green-eyed child brings calamity on the settlement. 
{PAUSE ""}
And that the child must be killed at once."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{PLAYSND "in_dream低.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
―What did you say!?<BR>
―Is that true!?<PG>
"<STYLE ID="1">Kotaro-kun</STYLE>, if you keep secrets from us, the trust in the Niimura family will be badly damaged."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"............"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Don't get me wrong, I'm not blaming <STYLE ID="1">you</STYLE>. 
{PAUSE ""}
We're only looking for a way for all of us to keep living in peace from here on. 
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">Your</STYLE> silence goes against that. 
{PAUSE ""}
One for all, all for one. Please, cooperate with us."<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"............"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"<STYLE ID="5">Kana-chan</STYLE> has green eyes too, doesn't she?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"............!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Perhaps <STYLE ID="5">Kana-chan</STYLE>, too, will one day―"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"P-please wait! You can't kill </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Kana</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">!"</STYLE><PG>
"Calm down, I didn't say anything of the sort. 
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">Chigaya-chan</STYLE> no longer has green eyes, as we've seen. 
{PAUSE ""}
If there's a way to change <STYLE ID="5">Kana-chan's</STYLE> eye color the same way, I'm asking you to do it. 
{PAUSE ""}
Then there's no need to kill anyone, right?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"That's... true. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">But it can't be dealt with until she's grown up to a certain point, like </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Chigaya</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">."</STYLE><PG>
"Then I want you to promise. 
{PAUSE ""}
If, in the future, anything strange happens to <STYLE ID="5">Kana-chan</STYLE>, you'll deal with it right away."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
―Hey, is that really okay!?<BR>
―What if it fails!?<BR>
―Shouldn't we do something right now!?<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"I'll take care of </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Kana</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, without fail. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">So..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Then let me ask you one more thing. 
{PAUSE ""}
What happened to <STYLE ID="2">Chigaya-chan</STYLE>?
{PAUSE ""}
　If you tell us that, I'll leave everything about <STYLE ID="5">Kana-chan</STYLE> to <STYLE ID="1">you</STYLE>. 
{PAUSE ""}
Everyone, is that all right?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
―We can't say anything as things stand.<BR>
―Well, let's hear what he has to say first.<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"Ngh... All right."</STYLE><BR>
{WAIT "100" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{DELETECG "文字カウント画像" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0"}
<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{STOPSND "BGM" "3000" "PASS"}
{DELETECG "000" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
<PG>
{}
<EVENT VALUE="MESEND">
;---------------------------------------
; END DECOMPILED SCRIPT
